    {
      "context_id": "D1",
      "physical_page": 4,
      "kind": "definition",
      "text": "(1) An onsite evaluation of a potential retail food establishment location.",
      "applies_to": [
        "R051"
      ],
      "native": {
        "start": 785,
        "end": 860,
        "sha256": "4d4fdcca68befc7f895210af7cc396d043327ec6879282806eb772f4a05134ab",
        "text": "(1) An onsite evaluation of a potential retail food establishment location.",
        "native_file": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/native/page-0004.txt",
          "sha256": "effad2643fd58bff7df4866e12ab6824b99cfb4350c8be3a164d854ddb7e0d80",
          "size_bytes": 3357
        },
        "image": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/pages/page-0004.png",
          "sha256": "26457f755b350e699002c49fc12be62ba4201c57a7707e04164a152383493301",
          "size_bytes": 559336
        },
        "physical_page": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "context_id": "D2",
      "physical_page": 4,
      "kind": "definition",
      "text": "(2) An onsite inspection of an approved retail food establishment that has undergone a change in ownership or an establishment that otherwise needs an onsite inspection prior to opening and for which changes to the facility do not meet the requirements of a plan review.",
      "applies_to": [
        "R052",
        "R053"
      ],
      "native": {
        "start": 862,
        "end": 1136,
        "sha256": "5a63864f519652b84b681a5b4ff2013d5cac25b43399b9caac6e2802b9138826",
        "text": "(2) An onsite inspection of an approved retail food establishment that has undergone a change in  \nownership or an establishment that otherwise needs an onsite inspection prior to opening and for  \nwhich changes to the facility do not meet the requirements of a plan review.",
        "native_file": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/native/page-0004.txt",
          "sha256": "effad2643fd58bff7df4866e12ab6824b99cfb4350c8be3a164d854ddb7e0d80",
          "size_bytes": 3357
        },
        "image": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/pages/page-0004.png",
          "sha256": "26457f755b350e699002c49fc12be62ba4201c57a7707e04164a152383493301",
          "size_bytes": 559336
        },
        "physical_page": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "context_id": "D3",
      "physical_page": 4,
      "kind": "definition",
      "text": "(3) A written document, based on HACCP (Hazard Analysis Critical Control Point) principles developed by the National Advisory Committee on Microbiological Criteria for Food, which formally identifies specific hazards that can adversely affect the safety of a food product and proposes control measures to maintain food safety.",
      "applies_to": [
        "R059"
      ],
      "native": {
        "start": 1139,
        "end": 1471,
        "sha256": "65e1ed257dd157cc4cf62efea790ada3e4c025e23403017eb98c0316c418416a",
        "text": "(3) A written document, based on HACCP (Hazard Analysis Critical Control Point) principles  \ndeveloped by the National Advisory Committee on Microbiological Criteria for Food, which  \nformally identifies specific hazards that can adversely affect the safety of a food product and  \nproposes control measures to maintain food safety.",
        "native_file": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/native/page-0004.txt",
          "sha256": "effad2643fd58bff7df4866e12ab6824b99cfb4350c8be3a164d854ddb7e0d80",
          "size_bytes": 3357
        },
        "image": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/pages/page-0004.png",
          "sha256": "26457f755b350e699002c49fc12be62ba4201c57a7707e04164a152383493301",
          "size_bytes": 559336
        },
        "physical_page": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "context_id": "D4",
      "physical_page": 4,
      "kind": "definition",
      "text": "(4) An observed process, based on HACCP principles developed by the National Advisory Committee on Microbiological Criteria for Food, that is conducted at an establishment, and which formally identifies specific hazards that can adversely affect the safety of a food product and provides control measures to maintain food safety.",
      "applies_to": [
        "R060"
      ],
      "native": {
        "start": 1474,
        "end": 1809,
        "sha256": "7f1ce3e463ddd051177d2a53e14b802019a9721479d942920cd9c52f987a64be",
        "text": "(4) An observed process, based on HACCP principles developed by the National Advisory  \nCommittee on Microbiological Criteria for Food, that is conducted at an establishment, and  \nwhich formally identifies specific hazards that can adversely affect the safety of a food product  \nand provides control measures to maintain food safety.",
        "native_file": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/native/page-0004.txt",
