    {
      "context_id": "D5",
      "physical_page": 4,
      "kind": "definition",
      "text": "(5) Repair, alteration, or addition to the soil treatment area (absorption area).",
      "applies_to": [
        "R022"
      ],
      "native": {
        "start": 1819,
        "end": 1900,
        "sha256": "f19ccda0cc212cd5adc313937739eef4ad20f8e445167b4ba223f834444da0ff",
        "text": "(5) Repair, alteration, or addition to the soil treatment area (absorption area).",
        "native_file": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/native/page-0004.txt",
          "sha256": "effad2643fd58bff7df4866e12ab6824b99cfb4350c8be3a164d854ddb7e0d80",
          "size_bytes": 3357
        },
        "image": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/pages/page-0004.png",
          "sha256": "26457f755b350e699002c49fc12be62ba4201c57a7707e04164a152383493301",
          "size_bytes": 559336
        },
        "physical_page": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "context_id": "D6",
      "physical_page": 4,
      "kind": "definition",
      "text": "(6) Repair or replacement of any portion of the system from the structure to the soil treatment area with the exception of repair or replacement of tank baffles and collapsed lines as depicted in the as-built drawings on file at Public Health.",
      "applies_to": [
        "R023"
      ],
      "native": {
        "start": 1902,
        "end": 2149,
        "sha256": "ac26911cf8b857e38bf63d514547f8b267010a604e080e2f3b8b4047d1025fe1",
        "text": "(6) Repair or replacement of any portion of the system from the structure to the soil treatment  \narea with the exception of repair or replacement of tank baffles and collapsed lines as depicted in  \nthe as-built drawings on file at Public Health.",
        "native_file": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/native/page-0004.txt",
          "sha256": "effad2643fd58bff7df4866e12ab6824b99cfb4350c8be3a164d854ddb7e0d80",
          "size_bytes": 3357
        },
        "image": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/pages/page-0004.png",
          "sha256": "26457f755b350e699002c49fc12be62ba4201c57a7707e04164a152383493301",
          "size_bytes": 559336
        },
        "physical_page": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "context_id": "D7",
      "physical_page": 4,
      "kind": "definition",
      "text": "(7) Reinspection/Additional Inspection” is defined as an additional revisit, or inspection, of an OWTS by an EHS for purposes of ensuring compliance with installation and regulation standards or requirements. Typically, this occurs when a requested inspection of an installation was not complete, not in compliance, or has outstanding items (such as well/electrical verification) that must be verified to comply with the regulations.",
      "applies_to": [
        "R033"
      ],
      "native": {
        "start": 2152,
        "end": 2595,
        "sha256": "a1fae527236f45a50b12fb4986d157f814ce5d7931f970fc89482679ab7267c1",
        "text": "(7) Reinspection/Additional Inspection” is defined as an additional revisit, or inspection, of an  \nOWTS by an EHS for purposes of ensuring compliance with installation and regulation standards  \nor requirements. Typically, this occurs when a requested inspection of an installation was not  \ncomplete, not in compliance, or has outstanding items (such as well/electrical verification) that  \nmust be verified to comply with the regulations.",
        "native_file": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/native/page-0004.txt",
          "sha256": "effad2643fd58bff7df4866e12ab6824b99cfb4350c8be3a164d854ddb7e0d80",
          "size_bytes": 3357
        },
        "image": {
          "path": "/Users/mcoors/Documents/Project Geode/MasterLegalDatabase/research/local_review/el-paso-ehs-fees-source-qa-2026-09-13/pages/page-0004.png",
          "sha256": "26457f755b350e699002c49fc12be62ba4201c57a7707e04164a152383493301",
          "size_bytes": 559336
        },
        "physical_page": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "context_id": "CHILDDEF",
      "physical_page": 4,
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Childcare:",
